WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:03,600
Don't come here

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:04,770
I really didn't expect that

3
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:05,850
You can't blame me for that, right?

4
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:10,530
What did you do with the kitchen knife? Don't let me tell you. I told you to say it was wrong. It was wrong.

5
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:19,050
I won’t say hello

6
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:23,940
Are you the eldest sister?
